Removed the redundant null fallback and made the common no-subfield case fall through to the base scale, avoiding an extra branch on every lookup.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetScale(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (subFieldIndex < GetNumSubFields())
        return GetSubField(subFieldIndex)->scale;

    return GetScale();
}
```